OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry, just the odd
OL,7,Fshower across the west. The rest of
OL,8,Fthe night will see a few showers in
OL,9,Fthe west, but dry in east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FMainly cloudy with some
OL,12,Fshowery rain across the west. Largely
OL,13,Fdry elsewhere with the best of any
OL,14,Fbright spells along the east coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fon Saturday with outbreaks of rain
OL,18,Falthough the east will be dry. Patchy
OL,19,Frain at first on Sunday, then dry. Dry
OL,20,Fon Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
